            <field name="name">Pakistan — Standard Private Sector</field>
            <field name="template_type">pakistan</field>
            <field name="working_days_per_month">26</field>
            <field name="note">
Standard private sector structure for Pakistan.
EOBI (Employees Old-Age Benefits Institution): PKR 370/month employee contribution (2024).
  Update this amount if the EOBI rate changes.
Provident Fund: 8.33% of basic — enable/disable per company policy.
SESSI/PESSI (Social Security): applicable in Sindh/Punjab; rate ~1-7% of wages.
  Add as custom deduction if applicable.
Income Tax (WHT): varies per slab; add as fixed deduction per employee.
Gratuity: 1 month's basic per completed year of service — provision monthly at 8.33%.
            </field>
        </record>

