Nepal: Provident Fund — Employee 10%, Employer 10%; CIT (Employee Welfare Fund) 1%.
Sri Lanka: EPF — Employee 8%; ETF — Employer 3% (not deducted from employee).
Festival allowance (Dashain bonus in Nepal) is paid annually — not provisioned here.
Dearness Allowance (DA) may apply in government or regulated sectors.
Adjust deduction rates and currency amounts to match the specific country requirements.
            </field>
